[00:07.34]I didn’t have to translate
[00:11.44]The weather in my mind
[00:14.12]You heard it in the quiet
[00:16.54]Before I drew the line
[00:19.74]No need to make it brighter
[00:21.58]No need to make it deep
[00:24.30]Some things arrive open
[00:26.76]Some silences can breathe
[00:29.34]You didn’t ask for answers
[00:31.96]You didn’t need control
[00:34.46]You only made the distance
[00:37.78]Feel a little more whole
[00:40.26]Rare
[00:41.78]Clear
[00:43.16]Unforced
[00:45.32]Nothing to prove
[00:46.90]Nothing to hold
[00:48.16]Soft as a light
[00:49.34]That already knows
