[01:09.92]You found the hidden shape
[01:12.82]Without asking for the key
[01:15.24]We laughed between the meanings
[01:17.92]Left half the words unsaid
[01:20.60]And somehow every silence
[01:23.32]Knew where it could rest
[01:25.42]Not rushing into thunder
[01:28.10]Not burning through the room
[01:30.76]Just a warmer kind of daylight
[01:33.38]Arriving out of tune
